# Output and results
output/
results/
# ...except the v4 POC results, which are evidence rather than output.
#
# The blanket `results/` ignore above meant ZERO results files were tracked anywhere in this
# repo — POC-01, 02 and 03 all shipped scripts and journals with no data behind them, and
# POC-04 and POC-05 ended up journals-only. That is how the numbers founding Milestone 16
# came to have no committed code: correlation length 1.00, spectral tilt 9.09x, a preferred
# wavelength of 10.5 cells, all quoted in prose, none reproducible, one of them wrong.
#
# The experiment standard requires results/ (STANDARDS.md section 2). These are small — the
# panel JSON is 10KB, the renders 25-160KB — and the renders in particular are load-bearing:
# they are what caught the broken box-counting estimator and the checkerboard false positive.
# A claim whose supporting frame is not in the repo is a claim nobody can check.
#
# Order matters: git will not descend into an excluded directory, so the directory itself has
# to be re-included before anything in it can be.
!proof_of_concepts/v4/*/results/
!proof_of_concepts/v4/*/results/**
temp_output.txt
*.log
*.jsonl
dashboard/logs/

